      "content": "It's not about being dramatic; it's about recognizing the unbearable weight you're under, and sometimes the only way to truly be in charge is to stop being controlled. While the idea of \"reclaiming control\" sounds so powerful, the reality is that the most absolute control you can ever have is over your own existence. If the current framework is entirely suffocating, then ending it is the final, definitive choice that no one else can take away from you.",
